      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello Bumgyu,\n\nAs mentioned in the commit text, right now vendor hook is called before error checks and most importantly before cpupri_find_fitness()/cpupri_find(). If we don\u0027t move the invocation of hook (don in this patch), vendor hook needs to do error checks and also need to call cpupri_find_fitness()/cpupri_find() which weren\u0027t even exported. I don\u0027t see any reason why we want vendor hooks to deal with such things when we can safely call the hook later which shouldn\u0027t break anything.\n\nPlease let me know if I missed anything. \n\nBest,\nSatya",
